# Unit26
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit26核心词汇

mouse/maʊs/老鼠/There is a mouse in the kitchen.
mouth/maʊθ/嘴/She opened her mouth to speak.
move/muːv/移动/We are moving to a new house next month.
much/mʌtʃ/许多/I don't have much free time.
multiple/ˈmʌltɪpl/多个的/He has multiple talents.
murder/ˈmɜːrdər/谋杀/The murder case shocked the whole city.
muscle/ˈmʌsl/肌肉/Regular exercise helps build muscle.
museum/mjuˈziːm/博物馆/We visited the National Museum yesterday.
music/ˈmjuːzɪk/音乐/She is very fond of classical music.
must/mʌst/必须/You must finish your homework before going out.
mutual/ˈmjuːtʃuəl/相互的/They have mutual respect for each other.
mystery/ˈmɪstri/神秘/The disappearance of the plane remains a mystery.
nail/neɪl/钉子；指甲/She painted her nails red.
name/neɪm/名字/What is your name?
narrow/ˈnæroʊ/狭窄的/The road is too narrow for two cars.
nation/ˈneɪʃn/国家/China is a great nation with a long history.
national/ˈnæʃnəl/国家的/National Day is celebrated on October 1st.
native/ˈneɪtɪv/本地的/She is a native speaker of English.
natural/ˈnætʃrəl/自然的/Natural resources should be protected.
nature/ˈneɪtʃər/自然；本性/We should live in harmony with nature.
naval/ˈneɪvl/海军的/He served in the naval force.
near/nɪr/近的/The school is near my home.
neat/niːt/整洁的/Her handwriting is very neat.
necessary/ˈnesəseri/必要的/Sleep is necessary for good health.
neck/nek/脖子/She wore a scarf around her neck.
need/niːd/需要/I need your help with this project.
negative/ˈneɡətɪv/消极的；否定的/Don't have such a negative attitude.
neglect/nɪˈɡlekt/忽视/Don't neglect your health.
negotiate/nɪˈɡoʊʃieɪt/谈判/The two sides are negotiating a peace deal.
neighbor/ˈneɪbər/邻居/Our neighbors are very friendly.
neither/ˈniːðər/两者都不/Neither of them is correct.
nerve/nɜːrv/神经/He has strong nerves in dangerous situations.
nervous/ˈnɜːrvəs/紧张的/She felt nervous before the interview.
neutral/ˈnjuːtrəl/中立的/Switzerland remained neutral during the war.
never/ˈnevər/从不/She never misses a day of work.
new/njuː/新的/He bought a new car last week.
news/njuːz/新闻/Have you heard the latest news?
next/nekst/下一个/Who is the next person in line?
nice/naɪs/好的/She is a very nice person.
night/naɪt/夜晚/The stars are bright at night.
no/noʊ/不/No, I don't agree with you.
noble/ˈnoʊbl/高尚的/He is a man of noble character.
nobody/ˈnoʊbədi/没有人/Nobody knows the answer to this question.
nod/nɑːd/点头/She nodded in agreement.
noise/nɔɪz/噪音/The noise from the construction site is very loud.
none/nʌn/没有一个/None of the students failed the exam.
normal/ˈnɔːrml/正常的/Everything is back to normal now.
north/nɔːrθ/北方/Beijing is in the north of China.
nose/noʊz/鼻子/He has a sharp nose.
not/nɑːt/不/I do not agree with your opinion.
